<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-31T00:55:30.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:55:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab fighters are stepping up attacks on Turkish-trained Somali troops in Lower Shabelle and ambushing units near Baidoa, and they killed a former al-Shabaab finance chief in Lower Shabelle. African Union peacekeepers are withdrawing from four bases in Lower Shabelle, while Ethiopia is pulling more than 3,000 troops from Somalia, further reducing external military presence. The Somali federal government has agreed to acquire Pakistani JF‑17 fighter jets and the United States has imposed entry conditions on ships calling at Somali ports. The UAE carried out its first drone strike against Al-Shabaab in nearly a year and piracy off Somalia’s coast is rising, with hijacked oil tankers and hostages reported. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSE84VGhwOGdhbkZGY1NNQXBYUURlSlRXMTF2ZWk2VmQ1MEhWTEJwTndFcFZwMUx2Uzk2cjNrN1VpMmFKU0pudkE2cEJ3cEllbkI1cHlJZG44SzdSekd2ay05NmROTzloY19LMXBBMVI1OXVLaXdzSW5lRk5IZVkzMXJ6aERNeXJTdlRJU2kwaHV0SUdfRElCRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPNzdxT0hGaF8yc29NbWhvQWJvcXEyLXNPTVMtOE9sSTNDMEYyNXNfVXowTGJaaGdSbFNtNnR3ZjBTTGt5Ry1PQnNRbHlSWG9OZFprY0p3SXhUYzlTQ05HYjYxQmk0dnA3ZjcyOFVlb0Q1azItTVFja3ZEVFdYdFhQaTQyZDYyWW5nXzktMm43Y3dDQXBvekJxc0xMMkM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPSWEzVTVTeTlDenBaT3gxNms0M1pOQTI1TGRGR2hmTVRCNVZuX3l4YmlNUkFUUnZYempNbnZXUFE1WDdWdmRSM1RWLXVESUZzX3k2TlRFY1l0bUhqNkhvVmd4OUlKbFNUVEhPVGpMWC02V1hiaXNvcGxScURCVUpqNWVHWUhTbTB0b2ZTd3NPMWR0enM4Wm13T0Y2d0REUWZtY1RqUmFR?oc=5&quot;&gt;PesaCheck&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPZktoempkMDgwU0FYOHlUOHlPVEY2NHpRWFdQT